  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "西班牙文(三)",
    "sub_ename": "SPANISH(3)",
    "describe_ch": "1. 透過生活相關的對話和更進階的文法教學，引導學生學習西文。\r\n2. 培養學生可以清晰朗讀和閱讀文章的能力。\r\n3. 藉由口語練習會話，提升學生聽說的表達能力。\r\n4. 更深入認識西班牙和拉丁美洲國家的風俗民情及文化。\r\n本學期的主題包括喜歡與疼痛的表達、飲食、詢問和回應地點、描述物品和用處、天氣等。於學期末學生應能提升聽說讀寫的能力。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "1.To guide students to learn Spanish by carrying on daily-life conversations and by learning advanced concepts of grammar\r\n2.To build up students’ abilities to clearly read out loud and read articles\r\n3.To improve students’ abilities to express themselves in speaking and listening with the practice of conversations\r\n4.To further learn and understand the customs and culture of Spain and Latin America\r\nThe course includes the expressions of likes and pains, food and drinks, asking for/giving \r\ndirections, the descriptions of objects and their uses, weather, etc. At the end of the semester, \r\nstudents would improve their abilities in listening, speaking, reading and writing.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "1.參與西班牙文的會話練習\t",
      "describe_en": "1. To join the practice of Spanish conversations"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "2.瞭解台灣與西班牙語世界的文化差異",
      "describe_en": "2. To understand the differences between Taiwan and Spain/Latin America"
    }
